DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, June 27\, 2026 at 4pm\n\nLocation: Shirley Temple E
 ducation Studio\n\nRuntime: 1h\n\nCost: Free with general admission\n\nTyp
 e: Conversations\n\nFilm composer\, music producer and Academy Governor Ri
 chard Gibbs shares the highlights of his illustrious career. \nThe compose
 r of such feature films as Say Anything (1989)\, Dr. Dolittle (1998)\, 10 
 Things I Hate About You (1999) and Queen of the Damned (2002) takes us beh
 ind the scenes of his musical journey.
