DESCRIPTION:Thursday\, July 9\, 2026\n\nLocation: Academy Museum of Motion
  Pictures\n\nRuntime: 2h 13m\n\n1997 | 133 min. | Japan | Color | Japanese
  with English subtitles | Rated PG-13 | 35mm\nDIRECTED/WRITTEN BY: Hayao M
 iyazaki \nWITH: Yoji Matsuda\, Yuriko Ishida\, Yuko Tanaka\, Kaoru Kobaya
 shi\nNew subtitled print courtesy of the Academy Film Archive\, with speci
 al thanks to Studio Ghibli.\n\nType: Screenings\n\nHayao Miyazaki’s inte
 rnational breakthrough is an epic cinematic marvel. Infected by a deadly c
 urse after killing a god\, young warrior Ashitaka heads west in search of 
 a cure. He stumbles upon a bitter conflict between Lady Eboshi\, the proud
  people of Iron Town\, and the enigmatic Princess Mononoke\, a girl raised
