 azaki \nWITH: Rumi Hiiragi\, Miyu Irino\, Mari Natsuki\, Takashi Naito \n
 New subtitled print courtesy of the Academy Film Archive\, with special th
 anks to Studio Ghibli.\n\nType: Screenings\n\nSpirited Away was Hayao Miya
 zaki’s first Oscar win\, and the first hand-drawn\, non-English-language
  animated film to win the Academy Award for Best Animated Feature. The fil
 m invites audiences into a mind-bending supernatural realm when a wrong tu
 rn on a family road trip lands 10-year-old Chihiro in a mysterious dimensi
 on populated by all manner of creatures\, including soot gremlins (first i
 ntroduced in My Neighbor Totoro)\, the giant witch Yubaba\, and\, most mem
