 iyazaki \nWITH: Chieko Baisho\, Takuya Kimura\, Akihiro Miwa\, Tatsuya Ga
 shûin\n\nType: Screenings\n\nAn adaptation of Diana Wynne Jones’s fanta
 sy novel of the same name\, the Oscar-nominated Howl’s Moving Castle is 
 a pitch-perfect fairy tale about aging and war\, set in a dazzling steampu
 nk world. When young hatmaker Sophie is transformed into a 90-year-old wom
 an by the vengeful Witch of the Waste\, she seeks to break the curse with 
 the help of the enigmatic wizard Howl\, the fire demon Calcifer\, and the 
 magical moving castle they inhabit.
